    "body": "Icons are working fine as well as font. The issue lies with ANSI sequences not being used or being filtered for some reason.\n\nEdit:\nAdding the following line in tmux.conf, allowed ANSI sequences to be rendered as outlined in [FAQs](https://github.com/tmux/tmux/wiki/FAQ#i-dont-see-italics-or-italics-and-reverse-are-the-wrong-way-round):\n```conf\nset -g default-terminal \"tmux\"\n```",
